{"id":481,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><div><div><p>为落实学校毕业生党员教育部署，扎实推进毕业生党员“五个一”教育活动，强化毕业生党员身份意识与纪律意识，引导党员做到学纪、知纪、明纪、守纪、文明离校、担当奉献。2026年6月16日，中北大学体育学院本科生党支部于学院会议室开展2026届毕业生党员主题党日活动，支部全体毕业生党员参会，活动由支部书记李佳怿主持。</p><p>活动中，支部书记围绕纪律教育、初心使命开展宣讲，解读毕业生党员先锋服务岗职责，号召党员主动参与离校秩序维护、行李帮扶等志愿服务，发挥先锋模范作用。随后，毕业生党员依次交流发言，回顾在校成长历程，分享入党感悟，承诺严守纪律规矩，践行文明离校要求，立足未来岗位担当作为。</p><p>在支部书记的带领下，全体党员面向党旗庄严宣誓，重温入党誓词，回望入党初心、淬炼党性修养，坚定矢志奋斗的理想信念。活动最后，支部为每位毕业生党员赠送纪念品，寄托支部的美好期许，勉励学子永葆党员本色、砥砺前行。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=tnRNjiMlLsnRUZLw87YM8MfnmVkUl-XsUm6fMll8Ll-4Um70gihFp2hmCIa0L1y4nky4LYhVLl7iUzLaU8M7L4WRM46VU8LiM7U4o7-solWFozV7LzffUNVFMmMfLzNJqjfjo4Oeosnb_dN0qIbtpYyPLRUDg47DoR7sgtA8pU/cc&oid=1054562613&tid=1046&nid=16817&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/23D33E1A5A30CCD32C77ECC54D38B79B/91D10ABA/63A19\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=tU4vjinmviU8Csow7UZU8laMN-aLmTXfLmf2nN-8L46fnzl0gihFp2hmCIa0Mkyboky4MYysMN-aMm-ZM8-bUmNsUlUZUzVfMlV2olnfLlVFUmW2LzGDM4AFMlW7olVVgtXaQ4Oeo4x8_5AbgDTJQty0LzG8M1yPMm9PMYbw62/8c&oid=1054562613&tid=1046&nid=16817&e=.jpg\"><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=tMRAj2L8nRnzMRMwNQfo77ZoRA7LRUXbnmrRU8LYol-sLz70gihFp2hmCIa0oSh7okh2nSysMNlYMRVVn7WRLmMkLRL4UmNPMR-4nzMRUzQFLRNsM4V7UmfFMmMfM7UJqjfjo4Oeosnb_dN0qIbtpYyPLRUDg47DoR7sgtA8pU/cc&oid=1054562613&tid=1046&nid=16817&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/9D8FE76E241EDBC23B033B91423E3CA6/09771DB0/63A4D\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=tMzLj4o7nVUm7anwmNiU4UinRf7olrX2L8CiozNiL49anNL0gihFp2hmCIa0okyDU1yZM1hfMl7PLmTVo7nRL7lYnNn7M8WknzLiL7lbMRrFMmVVM7UYMNrFL8UYMRMRgtXaQ4Oeo4x8_5AbgDTJQty0LzG8M1yPMm9PMYbw62/8c&oid=1054562613&tid=1046&nid=16817&e=.jpg\"></p></div></div></div></div>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://tyxy.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=tnRNjiMlLsnRUZLw87YM8MfnmVkUl-XsUm6fMll8Ll-4Um70gihFp2hmCIa0L1y4nky4LYhVLl7iUzLaU8M7L4WRM46VU8LiM7U4o7-solWFozV7LzffUNVFMmMfLzNJqjfjo4Oeosnb_dN0qIbtpYyPLRUDg47DoR7sg